---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import campusImg from '../assets/images/campus_fachada.webp';
import florSvg from '../assets/FLOR-BEIGE.svg';
---

<section id="historia" class="py-12 lg:py-16 xl:py-20 bg-brand-cream relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative Flor Symbol on the right side -->
  <div class="absolute -right-8 sm:-right-4 lg:right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[75%] lg:h-[92%] pointer-events-none select-none z-0 opacity-80 lg:opacity-90">
    <img
      src={florSvg.src}
      alt=""
      class="h-full w-auto object-contain object-right"
      aria-hidden="true"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-10 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-16">
      
      <!-- Left Image Column -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl w-full border-4 border-white/60">
          <Image
            src={campusImg}
            alt="Campus Pierre de Coubertin"
            width={800}
            height={600}
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Content Column -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 pr-0 lg:pr-6">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-brand-burgundy uppercase font-sans">
            NUESTRA HISTORIA
          </span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-[3.2rem] font-serif font-bold text-brand-charcoal leading-[1.1] mb-6">
          Más que un colegio,<br />
          <span class="text-brand-burgundy">una comunidad</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-brand-charcoal/90 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg max-w-2xl mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          En Pierre de Coubertin creemos en una educación que forma personas íntegras, comprometidas con su entorno y con la construcción de un mejor futuro.
        </p>

        <div>
          <a
            href="#historia"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-brand-burgundy text-white text-base lg:text-lg font-bold hover:bg-brand-burgundy-dark transition-all duration-200 shadow-md group focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-burgundy focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
          >
            <span>Conoce nuestra historia</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
